      "id": "claim_3830398e400e4d819baff0e2ec607665",
      "statement": "The wiki is regenerated by .github/workflows/openwiki-update.yml, triggered by workflow_dispatch and by push to main with paths-ignore for openwiki/**, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md and the workflow file itself (the OpenWiki blocks in AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md are rewritten every run and the first merge was measured to re-trigger it); it runs `openwiki code --update --print` with OPENWIKI_PROVIDER anthropic, the ANTHROPIC_API_KEY secret and the model from repository variable OPENWIKI_MODEL_ID (default claude-opus-5), and opens a pull request on branch openwiki/update via peter-evans/create-pull-request, with the recorded baseline in openwiki/.last-update.json advancing only when that PR is merged.",
